y que su esposa está embarazada | se lo dice él y que no quiere hablar más del matrimonio. Junior está feliz y pensando en regresar hoy mismo para su casa. ROKUro y Dionisia se despiden hasta una próxima vez." type="episode" contentRating="M/16" duration="3600000" grandparentArt="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/cgue-thum-wide.jpg" grandparentGuid="plex://show/6a1e25448907dc3c7000c157" grandparentKey="/library/metadata/6a1e25448907dc3c7000c157" grandparentRatingKey="6a1e25448907dc3c7000c157" grandparentThumb="https://provider-static.plex.tv/epg/cms/production/f0264004-d833-4809-8173-dc12f75e70e0/Novelisima_vert_2000x3000_-_Ali_Clausen.jpg" grandparentTitle="Guerra de Mujeres" grandparentType="show" index="29" originallyAvailableAt="2026-06-16T00:00:00Z" parentIndex="1" requiresConsent="1" skipParent="1" thumb="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/cgue-thum-wide.jpg" title="Episodio 32" userState="0" year="2026"><Image alt="Episodio 32" type="coverArt" url="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/cgue-thum-wide.jpg"/><Image alt="Episodio 32" type="coverPoster" url="https://provider-static.plex.tv/epg/cms/production/f0264004-d833-4809-8173-dc12f75e70e0/Novelisima_vert_2000x3000_-_Ali_Clausen.jpg"/><Image alt="Episodio 32" type="snapshot" url="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/cgue-thum-wide.jpg"/><Genre filter="genre=6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" id="6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" key="/library/sections/home/all?genre=6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" ratingKey="genre_6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" slug="en-espanol" tag="En Español" type="directory" context="tag.genre"/><Media beginsAt="1784678400" duration="3600000" endsAt="1784682000" id="6a56d5f1c07ffd26d7146c56" live="0" onAir="0" premiere="0" videoResolution="720" origin="livetv"/><Media beginsAt="1784700000" duration="3600000" endsAt="1784703600" id="6a56d5f1c07ffd26d7146c